<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Prudential starts aerospace.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Prudential starts aerospace.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities initiated coverage General Signal Corp, General Electric Co, Boeing Co and Honeywell Inc with buy ratings.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
